#   15     hard flag, no result in this module (clamped)
#   13     hard flag, no result in this module (subnormal)
#   9      hard flag, no result in this module (clamped,subnormal,underflow)
#   6      hard flag, no result in this module (overflow)
#   5      special value (NaN/Inf) or non-numeric operand

